Z||000003||kslish||05-30-2001||12:21 PM||||I was watching some foreign comedy movie on the International Channel this weekend (was bored way to late at night) and it was all in subtitles.  So some guy in the movie walks up to a bar and the bartender asks: <P>"Could I interest you in some liquid hops?"<P>I'm pretty sure he meant beer.  Cracked my stuff up at that time of night though....they need to pay their translators better or at least not take the English language so literal....<P>I hope American movies aren't translated so poorly in other non-English speaking countries...someone might take something out of context and start a war or something.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Ken S.<BR>||||reg||1
